<Panels>
  <config><![CDATA[{
  "published": true,
  "game_id": 73,
  "created_at": "2026-03-18T19:52:06.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 14639,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "offer_browser_tts": "true",
    "panels": [
      {
        "text": "Every website you've ever visited started as an idea in someone's head.\nBefore the code. Before the colors. Before the first click.\nIt started with a vision.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a6ec4e20446c3533a814af15c996a8f4-level1panel1.png",
        "key": "undefined-904541ec-483c-456e-aadb-a278e20e7bfe",
        "layout": "text-top-left",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "Being a web designer means being someone with a vision. It's about knowing what you want to build - and then figuring out how to turn that idea into something real.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a23a9885a621366e026cb649245b0e81-level1panel2.png",
        "key": "hoai-web-design-v2-1-11300f40-e480-4236-9f18-43bbbb1f36af",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "In this lesson, your collaborator is an AI. You'll describe your vision. It'll make a first attempt. And then the real work begins: your job is to look at the result and decide \"is this what I wanted?\"",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a4c6e3916083cf9e68d07401b846102f-level1panel3.png",
        "key": "hoai-web-design-v2-1-f5e574cf-2866-4ef1-8eaf-d3c1fd10e3e0",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "text": "You'll learn about code as you go - but that's not where you start. You start with a vision. Something you want to make, for someone who might need it. Just like every designer does.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/296f45ede7f2cf3a4fe9420626f5b2a7-level1panel4.png",
        "key": "hoai-web-design-v2-1-57828b9e-44f2-41ac-9a98-fd2c3841f424",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "Take a minute to think of your vision and what you want to create. Ready? Let's build something.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b1f8332cd8a3bf3a078eec9b52e15f45-level1panel5.png",
        "key": "hoai-web-design-v2-1-6e7bc154-78f1-4272-bcc4-af9d27c66454",
        "typing": true,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      }
    ]
  },
  "audit_log": "[{\"changed_at\":\"2026-03-18T19:52:06.866+00:00\",\"changed\":[\"cloned from \\\"hoai-web-design-panel-template\\\"\"],\"cloned_from\":\"hoai-web-design-panel-template\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-03-18 19:52:09 +0000\",\"changed\":[],\"changed_by_id\":14639,\"changed_by_email\":\"dan+teacher@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-03-19 04:35:59 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":14639,\"changed_by_email\":\"dan+teacher@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-03-19 04:41:00 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":14639,\"changed_by_email\":\"dan+teacher@code.org\"},{\"changed_at\":\"2026-03-19 04:42:07 +0000\",\"changed\":[\"panels\"],\"changed_by_id\":14639,\"changed_by_email\":\"dan+teacher@code.org\"}]"
}]]></config>
